{"slug":"n-f-r","ar":"ن ف ر","total":18,"core":"going forth; aversion; group","forms":[{"ar":"نَفَرَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":8,"gloss":"to go forth","word":null,"ex":{"s":4,"a":71,"p":6,"ar":["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","خُذُوا۟","حِذْرَكُمْ","فَٱنفِرُوا۟","ثُبَاتٍ","أَوِ","ٱنفِرُوا۟","جَمِيعًا"],"en":"O you who have believed, take your precaution and [either] go forth in companies or go forth all together"}},{"ar":"نُفُور","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":5,"gloss":"aversion","word":null,"ex":{"s":17,"a":41,"p":10,"ar":["وَلَقَدْ","صَرَّفْنَا","فِى","هَـٰذَا","ٱلْقُرْءَانِ","لِيَذَّكَّرُوا۟","وَمَا","يَزِيدُهُمْ","إِلَّا","نُفُورًا"],"en":"And We have certainly diversified [the contents] in this Qur'an that mankind may be reminded, but it does not increase the disbelievers except in aversion"}},{"ar":"نَفَر","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"men, group","word":null,"ex":{"s":18,"a":34,"p":13,"ar":["وَكَانَ","لَهُۥ","ثَمَرٌ","فَقَالَ","لِصَـٰحِبِهِۦ","وَهُوَ","يُحَاوِرُهُۥٓ","أَنَا۠","أَكْثَرُ","مِنكَ","مَالًا","وَأَعَزُّ","نَفَرًا"],"en":"And he had fruit, so he said to his companion while he was conversing with him, \"I am greater than you in wealth and mightier in [numbers of] men"}},{"ar":"مُّسْتَنفِرَة","kind":"active participle","form":10,"count":1,"gloss":"frightened, fleeing","word":null,"ex":{"s":74,"a":50,"p":3,"ar":["كَأَنَّهُمْ","حُمُرٌ","مُّسْتَنفِرَةٌ"],"en":"As if they were alarmed donkeys"}},{"ar":"نَفِير","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"numerous; manpower","word":null,"ex":{"s":17,"a":6,"p":11,"ar":["ثُمَّ","رَدَدْنَا","لَكُمُ","ٱلْكَرَّةَ","عَلَيْهِمْ","وَأَمْدَدْنَـٰكُم","بِأَمْوَٰلٍ","وَبَنِينَ","وَجَعَلْنَـٰكُمْ","أَكْثَرَ","نَفِيرًا"],"en":"Then We gave back to you a return victory over them. And We reinforced you with wealth and sons and made you more numerous in manpower"}}],"surahs":[[9,6],[17,3],[4,2],[18,1],[25,1],[35,1],[46,1],[67,1],[72,1],[74,1]]}